{"id":"603f4900cad3b0e0","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-measure7-finite-measurable-partition.md","title":"ZFC Measure7 Finite Measurable Partition","display":"df-zfc-measure7-finite-measurable-partition — ZFC Measure7 Finite Measurable Partition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure7-finite-measurable-partition","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure7-finite-measurable-partition"],"display":"df-zfc-measure7-finite-measurable-partition — ZFC Measure7 Finite Measurable Partition","depends_on":["[[58-df-finite]]","[[58-df-measurable-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure7-finite-measurable-partition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure7-finite-measurable-partition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure7-finite-measurable-partition — ZFC Measure7 Finite Measurable Partition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"58-df-finite\">58-df-finite</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7f96c502a4a99a46\" href=\"?note=7f96c502a4a99a46\" title=\"58-df-measurable-space\">58-df-measurable-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal P_0\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal P_0\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7f96c502a4a99a46\" href=\"?note=7f96c502a4a99a46\" title=\"58-df-measurable-space\">58-df-measurable-space</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7FiniteMeasurablePartition}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7FiniteMeasurablePartition}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}\">\\([A]^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure7\\text{-}finite\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}partition} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7FiniteMeasurablePartition}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal P_0)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathcal P_0\\in[\\mathcal A\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\}]^{&lt;\\omega}\\land X=\\bigcup\\mathcal P_0\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal P_0\\;\\forall B\\in\\mathcal P_0\\;(A\\neq B\\to A\\cap B=\\varnothing)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure7\\text{-}finite\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}partition} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7FiniteMeasurablePartition}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal P_0)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathcal P_0\\in[\\mathcal A\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\}]^{&lt;\\omega}\\land X=\\bigcup\\mathcal P_0\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal P_0\\;\\forall B\\in\\mathcal P_0\\;(A\\neq B\\to A\\cap B=\\varnothing)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Empty cells are excluded and every cell belongs to the sigma-algebra of the stated measurable space.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-finite]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measurable-space","status":"resolved","id":"7f96c502a4a99a46","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-measurable-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measurable-space","status":"resolved","id":"7f96c502a4a99a46","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-measurable-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$[A]^{<\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}$，其中 $\\mathrm{Finite}$ 见 [[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal P_0\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7FiniteMeasurablePartition}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"[A]^{<\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure7\\text{-}finite\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}partition} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7FiniteMeasurablePartition}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal P_0)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathcal P_0\\in[\\mathcal A\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\}]^{<\\omega}\\land X=\\bigcup\\mathcal P_0\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal P_0\\;\\forall B\\in\\mathcal P_0\\;(A\\neq B\\to A\\cap B=\\varnothing)","display":true}],"bytes":1320,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2631","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-measure7-finite-measurable-partition.md|58-df-zfc-measure7-finite-measurable-partition]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["d9a25b0ac94a3598","7f96c502a4a99a46"]}